# Manifest categories (setup/packages.yaml) the daisy desktop notebook is
# expected to have installed — read by pkg-missing, pkg-tui [missing] and
# `mise run pkg-install` (no args). Daisy is the main machine: everything.
#
# One category per line; `!pkgname` excludes a single package; # comments.

bootstrap-flatpak
bootstrap-mirrors
bootstrap-aur-helper
